<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>项目规划与能力全景</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>02 · Topic</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 40, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>一套浏览器可直接访问的 Web 应用；区别于通用聊天工具，把「课程」作为一等核心对象。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 14 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 208, flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>01  课件总结</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>已实现并可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>02  习题引导辅导</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>已实现并可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>03  自动生成复习计划</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>已实现并可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>04  课程记忆上下文隔离</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>已实现并可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>05  AI 错题本闭环</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>已实现并可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>06  学习资源包生成</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>已实现并可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>07  番茄专注计时</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>已实现并可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 281, height: 100, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>08  ESP32 联动</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>可选 · 未实机 · 不列入验收</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 220, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 310, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Image src="assets/ui_study_pack.png" style={{ width: 300, height: 211, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box><Box style={{ width: 310, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Image src="assets/ui_wrong.png" style={{ width: 300, height: 211, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box><Box style={{ width: 500, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>八项能力对应真实页面与接口</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 12 }}>课件总结、习题辅导、复习计划、课程记忆、错题闭环、资源包、番茄钟均由 REST 接口驱动；ESP32 联动接口与固件齐备但未实机联调，按需求文档第 11 章不列入验收。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>10 / 22</Text></Box></Slide>